    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76834" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰλίγ-γλωσσος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>contradictory, false</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγγέλων ῥῆσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>N.</u>
					1.58
				</span></i>
			; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρις οὐ π.</span>
				un<i>relenting</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Parth.</u>
				2.63
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>of strange</i> or <i>foreign tongue</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>I.</u>
					6(5).24
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύσφημος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				1098
			</span></i>.</div>
